ClamCove

ClamCove is a distribution of ClamAV, based on ClamAV by Cisco Systems, Inc.
(https://www.clamav.net/, https://github.com/Cisco-Talos/clamav).

ClamAV is a trademark of Cisco. ClamCove is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Cisco or the ClamAV project, and is not an official ClamAV release.

ClamCove is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2, as is
ClamAV; see COPYING. Third-party components keep their own licences; see
COPYING/ and COPYING.txt.

The differences from upstream ClamAV 1.5.4, each with its upstream status, are
listed in the table at the top of README.md.

Version output carries the ClamAV version first and unchanged, followed by the
distribution: "ClamAV 1.5.4 (ClamCove 1.5.4.6)". The distribution release
number is the CMake variable CLAMCOVE_RELEASE.
